{"edges": [{"fromNode": "afliccion", "id": "e1", "label": "salid sin prisa", "toNode": "pueblo"}, {"fromNode": "pueblo", "id": "e2", "label": "guardados", "toNode": "sion"}, {"fromNode": "arriba", "id": "e3", "toNode": "pueblo"}, {"fromNode": "abajo", "id": "e4", "toNode": "pueblo"}], "nodes": [{"height": 200, "id": "afliccion", "text": "## 🔥 BABILONIA\n**Aflicción / Cáliz**\n\n- ebria, no de vino (Is 51:21)\n- hambre · espada · red\n- inmundicia: no tocar", "type": "text", "width": 260, "x": -500, "y": 0}, {"height": 220, "id": "pueblo", "text": "## 🚶 PUEBLO EN MARCHA\n**Ordenado, no huyendo**\n\n- 🚶 🚶‍♀️ 🚶 🚶‍♀️\n- vasijas limpias\n- memoria + testimonio\n- sin prisa · con propósito", "type": "text", "width": 300, "x": -100, "y": 0}, {"height": 200, "id": "sion", "text": "## 🌅 SION\n**Luz y gozo**\n\n- limpieza\n- cántico\n- Is 52:12", "type": "text", "width": 260, "x": 340, "y": 0}, {"height": 100, "id": "arriba", "text": "☁️ **Jehová delante**\nÉl abre camino", "type": "text", "width": 280, "x": -100, "y": -200}, {"height": 100, "id": "abajo", "text": "🛡️ **Retaguardia**\nDios de Israel cubre", "type": "text", "width": 280, "x": -100, "y": 280}]}